OL,3,AHow Dolly Parton's business savvy
OL,4,Ahelped her succeed far beyond the
OL,5,Acharts
OL,6,
OL,7,FNot many musicians would snub a chance
OL,8,Fto work with Elvis Presley. But when
OL,9,FDolly Parton did so, it made her
OL,10,Fmillions.
OL,12,FIn 1974, after writing and recording I
OL,13,FWill Always Love You, Parton was asked
OL,14,Fif Presley could cover the song. She
OL,15,Fturned him down after his manager
OL,16,Fdemanded half the rights.
OL,18,F"Of course, I cried all night about
OL,19,Fthat," she later said of the ordeal in
OL,20,Fan interview.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
